  "2026-08-11T09:18:24.009Z","harness:codex","Evidence 2026-08-11: refreshed tsx to ^4.23.12 and esbuild to 0.28.2, raised the workspace override floor, and confirmed pnpm resolves only esbuild 0.28.2. pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities across 384 dependencies; fresh Trivy, credential scan, typecheck, contracts, package artifact, and exact 100% coverage gates pass. Remaining outdated entries are only the separately tracked incompatible npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 majors."
  "2026-08-11T11:01:54.648Z","harness:codex","Merged-head evidence 2026-08-11: PR #977 merged to main at 77bc5a8262e3b2c339d689b6b150d4d4f6371200. All required exact-head GitHub checks passed, all actionable review threads were resolved, and every bot response was read, reacted to, and acknowledged; final CodeRabbit and Sourcery requests were rate-limited and are recorded as provider limitations rather than approval. Local exact coverage passed 7,223 tests across 483 files at 100/100/100/100, and packed CLI/SDK acceptance passed in an isolated temporary project."
